From 6abf4580ee6cb62cc83a12e1fa895266bd5f2276 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:44:04 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 17/39] Add a "LiveHime danmaku" overlay source

A native OBS source that shows the latest room messages (chat, gifts,
Super Chats, guard purchases) on the canvas without a browser source.
Each overlay wraps a private FreeType text source; a UI-thread hub feeds
room events to all overlays and prunes expired lines twice a second.
Settings: font (Hiragino Sans GB by default, which FreeType can load from
/System/Library/Fonts), color, outline, shadow, lines, lifetime, width,
and which message kinds to show. The box size is fixed so layouts do not
jump. The font is copied field by field because settings merges drop
default-only objects.

An InjectOverlayEvent automation request (overlays only, nothing reaches
Bilibili) backs e2e-overlay.mjs, which renders into a temporary scene.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
